Subject: [PATCH 14/63] Glint: omnibox polish - row icons, keyboard nav, clean
 URL display, copy-link button

---
 .../frame/vertical_tab_strip_region_view.cc   | 133 ++++++++++++++++--
 .../frame/vertical_tab_strip_region_view.h    |  12 ++
 2 files changed, 131 insertions(+), 14 deletions(-)

